<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Randgold unit London listing gets go ahead.</title>
<headline>Randgold unit London listing gets go ahead.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mining firm Randgold &amp; Exploration Co Ltd said on Thursday that it had got shareholder approval for a scheme which will see the firm's Randgold Resources Ltd unit list on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The move, which will also include a global offer of new shares, got a requisite majority of votes at a shareholders' meeting on Wednesday, the firm said.</p>
<p>It added that more details of the outcome of the offer and the listing would be announced in due course.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
